# The build context is services/backend, so the rest of the monorepo is already
# outside it. This file is about what to keep out of *this* directory's upload.

# The big one. A local ./mvnw package leaves ~60 MB here; without this line it is
# uploaded on every build and a stale jar can be copied into the image.
target/

# Development data. Never in a production image — it seeds a shop that does not
# exist, into a database that has real ones.
dev-seed.sql

# Secrets, if anyone ever puts one here. Cloud values belong in the host's
# environment, never in a file — see DEPLOYMENT.md.
.env
.env.*

# Documentation is not part of the runtime.
README.md
DEPLOYMENT.md

# JVM crash dumps from a local run.
*.log
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Note what is deliberately NOT ignored: .mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar. The
# build stage needs it, and the root .gitignore already un-ignores it for the
# same reason.
